        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Allegro, the conductor of a travelling band, wakes up on a deserted island, all alone after a storm at sea leaves them shipwrecked and stranded. The rest of their band is nowhere to be found! Use magical instruments to traverse the island and discover the fates of their lost band members, but beware, fearsome foes and obstacles lurk around every corner...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this<strong> retro-styled 2D action platformer,</strong> collect magical instruments to improve your movement and combat capabilities. Use them to traverse obstacles, defeat foes, and complete multiple uniquely themed levels. These levels will test your skills and tenacity, requiring you to master and combine your instruments’ abilities to survive the island’s dangers!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swap between four different instruments, each with unique movement and combat abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many unique enemies and obstacles to overcome, each with different ways of moving and interacting with the player.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro-inspired difficulty, featuring an easy mode for less experienced players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three unique environments to explore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speedrun mode for hardcore gamers aiming to beat their best time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A complete storyline featuring dialogue scenes between the characters in the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adaptive soundtrack that changes based on the instruments you collect and use in-game.</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Allegro, the conductor of a travelling band, wakes up on a deserted island, all alone after a storm at sea leaves them shipwrecked and stranded. The rest of their band is nowhere to be found! Use magical instruments to traverse the island and discover the fates of their lost band members, but beware, fearsome foes and obstacles lurk around every corner...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this<strong> retro-styled 2D action platformer,</strong> collect magical instruments to improve your movement and combat capabilities. Use them to traverse obstacles, defeat foes, and complete multiple uniquely themed levels. These levels will test your skills and tenacity, requiring you to master and combine your instruments’ abilities to survive the island’s dangers!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swap between four different instruments, each with unique movement and combat abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many unique enemies and obstacles to overcome, each with different ways of moving and interacting with the player.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro-inspired difficulty, featuring an easy mode for less experienced players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three unique environments to explore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speedrun mode for hardcore gamers aiming to beat their best time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A complete storyline featuring dialogue scenes between the characters in the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adaptive soundtrack that changes based on the instruments you collect and use in-game.</p></li></ul>",
